+"""
+    atomic_orbital_projections(basis, ψ; [isonmanifold, positions])
+
+Build the projection matrices of ψ onto each pseudo-atomic orbital.
+
+    projection[ik][iband, iproj] = ‖ ψ'[ik][:, iband] * projector[ik][:, iproj] ‖²
